  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Syst&#xe8;me de Reporting Ax&#xe9; sur les R&#xe9;sultats de la Banque</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In its endeavor to develop a results reporting system for the Bank, the project milestones in  2009/10 include the finalization of a concept note which was presented during the ADF XI Mid Term Review and the finalization of a functional prototype in December 2010. The Technical Department had expected to deploy the prototype in the first quarter of 2011 and this output is yet to be realized. The projected timeframe for the configuration of the new supervision format (Project Implementation &amp; Results Report) is the end of April 2011 and the full system is expected to function in all departments of the Bank. Some of the lessons learned are that the development of any new system requires the political buy in of Vice President&#x2019;s and Directors at the highest levels.  It is also critical to involve CIMM in the development of the prototype and the system should be integrated with SAP in order to succeed. The expected impact is an integrated results reporting system for the Bank by April 2012.
Approved: CAD 370,373 (Disbursed: 52.2%)</narrative>
  </description>
